let that mislead you. They have very affordable seafood. I got both boiled crawfish & shrimp with potatoes & corn. My favorite was the crawfish. I think I'll skip the shrimp next time. The crawfish had all the flavor. Service was very quick. I'll definitely come back."},{"business_id":"RC5DvxYvcR_RXfefEHJIMQ","review_id":"NcAd5BAmEZA2AYKHbImX1Q","date":"2017-02-06T17:22:48","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9283616542816162,"text_excerpt":"Stopped by here yesterday an hour before the Super Bowl to pick up crawfish. The line was almost out the door but moved very quickly. The workers are awesome! My boyfriend and I tried the crawfish, shrimp, sausage and potatoes. The crawfish was spicy, just the way I like, and full of flavor. We brought the food to a friend's house and everyone commented on how good the crawfish was."},{"business_id":"RC5DvxYvcR_RXfefEHJIMQ","review_id":"Rz7Kb8aJ6-O2KQmgtpPBTg","date":"2020-04-11T22:31:13","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9161749482154846,"text_excerpt":"Phoned in an order for 5 lbs of boiled crawfish with potatoes and corn alone with a shrimp poboy and was told our order would be ready in 7 minutes.. This location is not in the best neighborhood and the storefront they operate out of is tiny, but when we arrived our order was ready, we were able to quickly pay and minutes later we were home feasting on our 5 lbs of crawfish and the huge shrimp poboy. The crawfish was fresh of mixed sizes with some huge and was delightfully spicy! So if you are in the mood for great crawfish that can be easily ordered and picked up I highly recommend Soul's Seafood Market. And again FYI this small seafood market is not in the best location, but their craw..."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
